Number: 357
Topic: Christian Church - 

Verse 1:
[Fm]Come, [Cm/G]labor [Ab]on.
[Fm]Who dares [Ab]stand [Bbm]idle [Ab]on [Db]the [Cm]harvest plain
[Eb]While [Fm]all [Eb]around him [Ab]waves [Fm]the golden [Cm]grain?
[Fm]And to [Eb]each [Db]servant [Cm]does [Ab]the Master [Fm]say,
[Cm/G]"Go [Ab]work [Gdim]today."

Verse 2:
[Fm]Come, [Cm/G]labor [Ab]on.
[Fm]Claim [Gdim]the [Ab]high [Bbm]calling [Ab]angels [Cm]cannot share;
[Eb]To young [Fm]and [Eb]old the [Ab]gospel [Fm]gladness [Cm]bear;
